== Walkthrough ==

''This quest follows [[Rat Patrol]], given by [[Jeet]], located at 563, 193, -33 outside the Ratsbone Treasury & Assay Office. You must have Amiable faction to complete this quest.''

You say, 'I will run to the gnome city'

: Jeet says, 'Well, as you most likely know, we here are a non profit organization,.. In Kaladim. We need to make our profit elsewhere and that means a little bit of thieving. Presently we need loyal members to [collect the gnome profit].'

You say, 'I will collect the gnome profit'

: Jeet says, 'Take this key. Don't lose it!! You will need to use it on a metal rat called a Scrubber. They are all over Ak'Anon. You must find the one which responds to the number, '628'. If it responds then use the key on it. It will hand over a bag with the 'Gnome Take'. Return it to me. Get moving!!.'

''[[clockwork scrubber]]s can be found roaming within [[Ak'Anon]]''

You say, 'Hail, clockwork scrubber'

''The [[clockwork scrubber]] does not respond, but will pause in its pathing.''

You say, '628'

: clockwork scrubber says 'wiz... tik... 628'

'''If you get the prior response, give the [[clockwork scrubber]] the key you received from [[Jeet]]. You will be given the [[Gnome Take]] in return.'''

* Your faction standing with [[Clockworks of Ak`Anon]] has been adjusted by -5.

'''Hand [[Jeet]] the [[Gnome Take]].'''

: Jeet says, 'What is all this junk! That blasted tin rat is supposed to be heisting expensive goods from rich gnomes - not all this garbage! Here. This is your cut of this junk.'

''Alternatively, you might see the text''

: Jeet says, 'Good work miner. This is a fantastic haul! Those wrinkly little gnomes don't know what is going on. Here is your cut. Now get back to work.'

